WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:15.033
Sanjay was in the kitchen when his sister, Priya, ran by.

2
00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:19.717
She had a bundle of markers and several pieces of cardboard.

3
00:00:22.499 --> 00:00:27.484
The next time she went by, she had a Betsy doll and a Space Man figure.

4
00:00:28.684 --> 00:00:30.125
"That's my Space Man!"

5
00:00:30.665 --> 00:00:31.445
Sanjay said.

6
00:00:31.465 --> 00:00:33.766
"What are you doing, Priya?"

7
00:00:34.887 --> 00:00:36.727
He followed her into the family room.

8
00:00:36.747 --> 00:00:41.329
"I was watching videos on the Internet," Priya said.

9
00:00:41.349 --> 00:00:46.051
"I saw a film that a kid made and decided to make one myself."

10
00:00:47.632 --> 00:00:49.193
Sanjay's eyes lit up.

11
00:00:49.573 --> 00:00:50.593
"You'll need actors!

12
00:00:51.034 --> 00:00:52.374
Can I be in your movie?"

13
00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:54.435
Priya shook her head.

14
00:00:54.455 --> 00:00:56.396
"I don't need actors.

15
00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:59.822
This is going to be a stop-motion animation."

16
00:00:59.842 --> 00:01:02.843
"Animation?" Sanjay asked.

17
00:01:02.863 --> 00:01:07.986
"I'm going to take lots of pictures of Betsy and Space Man.

18
00:01:09.607 --> 00:01:13.609
I'll move them a little between each picture," Priya explained.

19
00:01:13.629 --> 00:01:18.652
"When I put all the pictures together, it will look like they're moving!

20
00:01:19.192 --> 00:01:19.833
Want to help?"

21
00:01:19.853 --> 00:01:25.816
"Sure." Sanjay helped Priya color buildings on a piece of cardboard.

22
00:01:28.012 --> 00:01:30.393
"This will be the background," Priya said.

23
00:01:30.413 --> 00:01:33.434
"Betsy is going to chase Space Man."

24
00:01:33.454 --> 00:01:36.055
"Why is she going to chase him?"

25
00:01:36.555 --> 00:01:37.496
Sanjay asked.

26
00:01:38.516 --> 00:01:39.297
Priya shrugged.

27
00:01:41.437 --> 00:01:42.438
Sanjay laughed.

28
00:01:42.458 --> 00:01:46.299
"Priya, she needs to have a reason for chasing him.

29
00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:50.361
If she doesn't, the film won't be interesting.

30
00:01:51.421 --> 00:01:55.363
Let's come up with a story with a beginning, middle, and end."

31
00:01:56.243 --> 00:01:57.744
Priya and Sanjay thought.

32
00:01:58.956 --> 00:02:00.538
"Okay," Priya said.

33
00:02:00.558 --> 00:02:03.260
"Betsy puts down her favorite marker.

34
00:02:04.161 --> 00:02:08.245
When she isn't looking, it rolls away and Space Man finds it.

35
00:02:08.665 --> 00:02:16.772
He picks it up and—" "Betsy thinks he stole the marker," Sanjay added, "so she chases him!"

36
00:02:18.674 --> 00:02:19.515
Priya smiled.

37
00:02:20.235 --> 00:02:24.179
"Perfect! Then he falls down and she takes back the marker.

38
00:02:24.639 --> 00:02:25.160
The end!"

39
00:02:26.532 --> 00:02:28.974
Sanjay set up the cardboard background.

40
00:02:30.936 --> 00:02:33.839
He placed paper and a marker in front of Betsy.

41
00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:36.181
Priya got the camera ready.

42
00:02:38.743 --> 00:02:41.286
Priya took a picture of Betsy with the marker.

43
00:02:42.166 --> 00:02:46.030
Then Sanjay moved Betsy's hand, just a tiny bit.

44
00:02:46.751 --> 00:02:48.092
Priya took another picture.

45
00:02:49.233 --> 00:02:52.416
After a long time, they had a bunch of pictures.

46
00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:57.962
They uploaded the pictures to a filmmaking program on Priya's laptop.

47
00:02:59.362 --> 00:03:03.123
The program quickly showed all the pictures, one at a time.

48
00:03:03.143 --> 00:03:05.884
"Cool!" Sanjay said.

49
00:03:05.904 --> 00:03:09.465
"It looks like Betsy is drawing with the marker!"

50
00:03:10.025 --> 00:03:13.666
Next they filmed the marker rolling away from Betsy.

51
00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:18.408
Then they took pictures of Space Man picking up the marker.

52
00:03:20.708 --> 00:03:24.150
"Now we film the big chase scene," Priya said.

53
00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:31.054
They spent all afternoon moving Betsy and Space Man tiny little bits at a time.

54
00:03:32.354 --> 00:03:35.236
They uploaded the rest of the pictures to the laptop.

55
00:03:35.856 --> 00:03:39.858
Sanjay and Priya recorded voices for Space Man and Betsy.

56
00:03:40.939 --> 00:03:42.760
Then they added some music.

57
00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:46.862
When they were finished, they showed the movie to their parents.

58
00:03:46.882 --> 00:03:52.018
"Let's upload this to the Internet," Priya said after the movie.

59
00:03:52.678 --> 00:03:53.559
Sanjay grinned.

60
00:03:53.579 --> 00:03:57.503
"Maybe it will inspire other kids to make movies too!"
